ading="lazy" src="/media/asset-room-1/v1/jasmin.jpg" width="1200" height="900"/></div><div class="p-3"><h3 class="mb-0.75 font-[inherit] text-site-sm">Jasmine Room</h3><p class="text-site-xs text-site-ink-soft">Patio · sleeps 2</p><p class="mt-2.25 text-site-sm text-site-accent">120</p></div></a><a class="overflow-hidden rounded-site border border-site-hairline bg-site-card block" href="/rooms/terrasse"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-site-media-fill aspect-[4/3] rounded-none"><img class="size-full object-cover" alt="Suite Terrasse" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/media/asset-room-3/v1/terrasse.jpg" width="1200" height="900"/></div><div class="p-3"><h3 class="mb-0.75 font-[inherit] text-site-sm">Terrace Suite</h3><p class="text-site-xs text-site-ink-soft">Terrasse · 3 personnes</p><p class="mt-2.25 text-site-sm text-site-accent">180</p></div></a></div><div class="hl-float-layer pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-10 *:pointer-events-auto"></div></div></section><section data-hl-block="blk-home-quote" data-hl-block-type="quote" lang="en" dir="ltr" class="hl-blk hl-blk-quote text-center"><figure class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-site-content"><blockquote class="mb-3.5 max-w-[30ch] font-heading text-[length:calc(var(--site-type-lg)*0.92)] leading-[1.35] mx-auto" data-hl-field="quote"><p>“On est arrivés pour deux nuits, on est restés une semaine.”</p></blockquote><figcaption class="text-site-xs tracking-[0.08em] text-site-ink-soft uppercase" data-hl-field="by">Léa &amp; Karim, Lyon</figcaption><div class="hl-float-layer pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-10 *:pointer-events-auto"></div></figure></section><section data-hl-block="blk-home-cta" data-hl-block-type="ctaBand" lang="en" dir="ltr" class="hl-blk hl-blk-ctaBand bg-site-accent text-site-on-accent"><div class="relative mx-auto flex w-full max-w-site-content flex-wrap items-center gap-6"><div class="min-w-60 flex-1"><h2 class="mb-1.5 text-site-lg" data-hl-field="title">Réservez votre séjour</h